---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About | Eugene Agyeman"
	description="Eugene Agyeman is a software engineer in London working on real-time backend systems, mostly in Go and Java."
>
	<section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-20">
		<h1
			class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white dark:text-white leading-[1.1]"
		>
			Hey!
		</h1>

		<div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg text-white/90 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
			<p>
				I build backend systems, mostly in Go and Java. I'm more interested in what happens
				when the volume is ten times what anyone planned for than in writing the service
				itself.
			</p>
			<p>
				These days I work on the rules behind a real-time alerting product. Agencies write the
				rules, events come in, and the system decides whether someone needs to know. I look
				after the whole path: the data model, the evaluation, and the screens our own
				operators use to manage it. In practice, that means I'm the one who gets paged.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="border-t border-white/20 dark:border-white/5">
		<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-white/95 dark:text-cyan-500 mb-5">
				A typical day
			</h2>
			<div class="space-y-5 text-lg text-white/90 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
				<p>
					Mostly back and forth. There's design work early, a few reviews, a fair bit of
					back-and-forth with the people using the thing I'm building, and then whatever
					needs fixing.
				</p>
				<p>
					I still write a good amount of code. I just rarely get to do it in one go.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="border-t border-white/20 dark:border-white/5">
		<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-white/95 dark:text-cyan-500 mb-5">
				Outside of that
			</h2>
			<div class="space-y-5 text-lg text-white/90 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
				<p>
					I'm returning to cooking, and the pizzas have come out well. I'm also returning
					to running, which is going less well. There is a lot of returning to do at the
					moment.
				</p>
				<p>
					Music is a constant. Getting away is the other one, and the further the better. I
					collect countries rather than going back to the same ones.
				</p>
				<p>
					I don't read enough, which is something I'd like to sort out. I do go back to
					distributed systems papers when something at work doesn't have an answer I find
					satisfying.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="border-t border-white/20 dark:border-white/5">
		<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
			<p class="text-lg text-white/90 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
				If you want the technical detail, the stack, the projects, the numbers, it's all
				in my CV.
			</p>
			<a
				href="/cv"
				class="inline-block border border-white/50 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"
			>
				View CV
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
